### ============================================================
### JC RAG 智能知识库系统
### Elasticsearch 一体化初始化脚本
### 作用：
### 1. 创建主文档分块向量索引
### 2. 创建会话记忆辅助索引
### 说明：
### - `jc_rag_chunks` 为必建索引
### - `jc_chat_memory` 为可选索引
### - 执行前请确认 ES 已启动：http://localhost:9200
### 变更记录：
### - 2026-06-17: 向量字段名 embedding_vector（与业务代码 RAG 入库逻辑一致），
###   新增 chunk_text_ws 字段以保留历史数据；沿用原 hnsw 索引参数；
###   若库内已存在该索引，执行 PUT 会报 resource_already_exists_exception，忽略即可
### ============================================================

### 1. 创建主索引：文档分块向量索引
### 用途：
### - 存储文档分块文本
### - 存储元数据
### - 存储 embedding 向量
PUT http://localhost:9200/jc_rag_chunks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settings": {
    "number_of_shards": 1,
    "number_of_replicas": 0,
    "analysis": {
      "analyzer": {
        "default_text_analyzer": {
          "type": "standard"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "chunk_id":          { "type": "keyword" },
      "document_id":       { "type": "keyword" },
      "kb_id":             { "type": "keyword" },
      "file_name": {
        "type": "text",
        "fields": {
          "keyword": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },
      "doc_type":          { "type": "keyword" },
      "security_level":    { "type": "keyword" },
      "section_title": {
        "type": "text",
        "fields": {
          "keyword": { "type": "keyword" }
        }
      },
      "page_no":           { "type": "integer" },
      "chunk_text":        { "type": "text" },
      "chunk_text_keyword": {
        "type": "keyword",
        "ignore_above": 8191
      },
      "chunk_text_ws":     { "type": "text" },
      "version_no":        { "type": "integer" },
      "created_at":        { "type": "date" },
      "embedding_vector": {
        "type": "dense_vector",
        "dims": 1024,
        "index": true,
        "similarity": "cosine",
        "index_options": {
          "type": "hnsw",
          "m": 16,
          "ef_construction": 64
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

### 2. 创建可选索引：会话记忆辅助索引
### 用途：
### - 存储会话摘要
### - 为多轮上下文增强提供可选能力
PUT http://localhost:9200/jc_chat_memory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settings": {
    "number_of_shards": 1,
    "number_of_replicas": 0
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "memory_id": { "type": "keyword" },
      "session_id": { "type": "keyword" },
      "user_id": { "type": "keyword" },
      "summary_text": { "type": "text" },
      "created_at": { "type": "date" },
      "embedding": {
        "type": "dense_vector",
        "dims": 1024,
        "index": true,
        "similarity": "cosine"
      }
    }
  }
}
